OL,3,GNEWSAMajor road to close for days due
OL,4,Ato storm damage
OL,5,
OL,6,FA major section of York's inner ring
OL,7,Froad is to remain closed for several
OL,8,Fdays due to storm damage overnight.
OL,10,FA section of the Fishergate Gyratory
OL,11,Fwas closed on Sunday evening after
OL,12,Fheavy rain caused the tarmac to lift on
OL,13,Fthe road surface, according to the fire
OL,14,Fservice.
OL,16,FCity of York Council said road would
OL,17,Fremain closed "for a few days" and
OL,18,Ftraffic heading eastbound on Tower
OL,19,FStreet would be diverted via Piccadilly
OL,20,Fand Walmgate Bar.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
