OL,3,GNEWSAMajor road to close for days due
OL,4,Ato storm damage
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council statement said: "The road
OL,7,Fwill need to be closed for a few days
OL,8,Fwhile we work with Yorkshire Water to
OL,9,Funderstand the cause, then get it
OL,10,Ffixed."
